# Operational data must never enter this repository.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.csv
*.tsv
*.json
!data/demo.json
!package.json

# The OCHA/NDRRMA exchange feed is the ONE reviewed place where published
# aggregates may be committed: it is public-safe by contract (aggregates only,
# small cells suppressed, P-code join key) and a machine check refuses to build
# it if it breaks that contract. Nothing else under exchange/ is whitelisted --
# a stray operational file dropped there still fails. See exchange/README.md.
!exchange/*.csv
!exchange/CHANGELOG.md
!exchange/README.md
!exchange/schema.json
!exchange/source/*.json

# Working files
shot-*.png
